  "body": "This removes the categories:\n* select element inner content elements\n* optgroup element inner content elements\n* option element inner content elements in order to simplify the specification a bit.\n\nIt does so by making the div content model rules that use these concepts instead use the transparent content model concept, which works for these cases and is perhaps also more clear.\n\nThis is a followup to #12504 and also has the goal of simplifying the content model changes we will need in #12011.  (I think #12011 may also need the concept of limiting this transparency to certain close descendants but not all descendants, but I don't think that concept is needed for the select content models.)\n\n(Sorry, I wrote this last week right after landing #12504, but I forgot to actually create the PR!)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12568/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 7, 2026, 4:02 PM UTC (c099dfb)\">/dom.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12568/2a92e95...c099dfb/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 7, 2026, 4:02 PM UTC (c099dfb)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12568/form-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 7, 2026, 4:02 PM UTC (c099dfb)\">/form-elements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12568/2a92e95...c099dfb/form-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 7, 2026, 4:02 PM UTC (c099dfb)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12568/grouping-content.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 7, 2026, 4:02 PM UTC (c099dfb)\">/grouping-content.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12568/2a92e95...c099dfb/grouping-content.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 7, 2026, 4:02 PM UTC (c099dfb)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12568/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 7, 2026, 4:02 PM UTC (c099dfb)\">/index.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12568/2a92e95...c099dfb/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 7, 2026, 4:02 PM UTC (c099dfb)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12568/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 7, 2026, 4:02 PM UTC (c099dfb)\">/indices.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12568/2a92e95...c099dfb/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 7, 2026, 4:02 PM UTC (c099dfb)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12568/scripting.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 7, 2026, 4:02 PM UTC (c099dfb)\">/scripting.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12568/2a92e95...c099dfb/scripting.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 7, 2026, 4:02 PM UTC (c099dfb)\">diff</a> )",
